From minecraft.wiki protocol, Map (0x26 in 1.20.1):
- Map ID: VarInt
- Scale: Byte
- Tracking Position: Boolean
- Locked: Boolean
- Icon Count: VarInt
- Icons: Array of Map Icons
- Width: Unsigned Byte (128 for full)
- Height: Unsigned Byte (128 for full)
- X: Byte
- Z: Byte
- Data Length: VarInt
- Data: Array of Bytes

Data layout note from wiki.vg: "The data is stored in columns, i.e. X changes faster than Z. If Columns is 128, then the data is stored in rows, i.e. Z changes faster than X."

